                        <li>
                            <strong>Fast Rollback / Restore</strong> (example with <code>http://localhost:5000</code> and <code>http://localhost:5001</code>)
                            <p><img src="./images/pub_4.gif" alt="Version Rollback"></p>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
